#: ../../source/integrations-guide/slash-commands.rst:22
msgid ""
"These out-of-the-box commands enable command line interaction with users,"
" channels, and conversations. Examples of pre-built slash commands "
"include ``/invite`` to add teammates to a channel, ``/header`` to set a "
"channel description, or ``/call`` to start or join a call in a channel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/slash-commands.rst:24
msgid ""
"Additionally, you can interact with the data model programmatically using"
" `API endpoints <https://api.mattermost.com/>`__. Responses are posted as"
" the user who invoked the command, with possible username/icon overrides."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/slash-commands.rst:26
msgid ""
