#: ../../source/integrations-guide/slash-commands.rst:46
msgid ""
"Typing ``/jira create`` opens an interactive dialog where you can file a "
"new Jira issue directly from Mattermost, including fields like summary, "
"description, and priority."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/slash-commands.rst:48
msgid "**Incident response**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/slash-commands.rst:50
msgid ""
"Using ``/pagerduty trigger`` can open a form to start a new incident, "
"notify on-call responders, and post details back into the channel so the "
"team can coordinate."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/integrations-guide/slash-commands.rst:52
